    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d72">

                <pb facs="0159" n="77" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg77"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Sanford</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 165.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-03-25"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 25, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I enclose for your information a copy of a
                    late instruction addressed to Mr. Bigelow, and also to Messrs. Adams, Perry and
                    Wood, relative to the pirate Stonewall, otherwise Olinde or Stoerkodder.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry S. Sanford,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., Brussels.</hi></p>
                    <p>(For enclosure see despatch No. 1302 to Mr. Adams.)</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
